# --- Source masters: NOT in the repo, deliberately ---------------------------
# GitHub Pages serves everything a repo contains, so anything committed here is
# publicly downloadable from www.elite-carpentry.ca. Neither of these is needed
# to build or serve the site — the generated derivatives are committed — and
# both carry reasons not to publish them:
#
#   elitelogo/   the designer's package (EPS, PDF, SVG, PNG, JPG). 356 MB, and
#                the EPS alone is 333 MB — past GitHub's 100 MB per-file hard
#                limit, so committing it would fail the push outright. It is the
#                print and signage archive; it belongs in the client's own file
#                store, not in a web repo.
#
#   originals/   full-resolution job photo masters, ~27 MB. Includes five
#                photographs deliberately NOT published (see UNUSED in
#                tools/content_projects.py) and the full-size original of Jake's
#                family photo. The client approved the 480px crop appearing on
#                the site; committing the master publishes more than that.
#
# KEEP LOCAL BACKUPS. A fresh clone can build and serve the whole site, but it
# cannot regenerate images from source without these. tools/brand-assets.py and
# tools/project-photos.py both fail with a clear message if they are missing.
assets/img/brand/elitelogo/
assets/img/photos/originals/
